#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:1
msgid "Why there are three ways to build the same model"
msgstr "Mengapa ada tiga cara membangun model yang sama"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:3
msgid "From the advanced tier down to the beginner tier, each asks for one decision fewer, and all three end in the same model."
msgstr "Dari tingkat mahir turun ke tingkat pemula, setiap tingkat meminta satu keputusan lebih sedikit, dan ketiganya berakhir pada model yang sama."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:6
msgid "The question"
msgstr "Pertanyaannya"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:8
msgid "Three functions build the same model. `hbm_gaussian()` takes a response and a list of auxiliary variables. `hbm_flex()` takes the same plus a family. `create_model()` takes a formula. Which one is the real API, and what are the others for?"
msgstr "Tiga fungsi membangun model yang sama. `hbm_gaussian()` menerima respons dan daftar variabel penyerta. `hbm_flex()` menerima hal yang sama ditambah family. `create_model()` menerima formula. Mana API yang sesungguhnya, dan untuk apa yang lain?"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:12
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Latar belakang"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:14
msgid "The R package hbsaems arranges its modelling functions in three layers (Choir et al., 2026): SAE-friendly wrappers such as `hbm_betalogitnorm()`, the flexible `hbm_flex()`, and the universal `hbm()`. Most users start with a wrapper and step up a layer when a model needs more control."
msgstr "Paket R hbsaems menyusun fungsi pemodelannya dalam tiga lapisan (Choir dkk., 2026): wrapper yang ramah SAE seperti `hbm_betalogitnorm()`, `hbm_flex()` yang fleksibel, dan `hbm()` yang universal. Sebagian besar pengguna memulai dengan wrapper dan naik satu lapisan ketika model membutuhkan kendali lebih."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:19
msgid "hbsaemp keeps that design and names each tier after the programming it expects from the user:"
msgstr "hbsaemp mempertahankan rancangan itu dan menamai setiap tingkat menurut kemampuan pemrograman yang diharapkannya dari pengguna:"

