msgid "Tier"
msgstr "Tingkat"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "User"
msgstr "Pengguna"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Function"
msgstr "Fungsi"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "You supply"
msgstr "Yang Anda berikan"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Decided for you"
msgstr "Yang diputuskan untuk Anda"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Beginner"
msgstr "Pemula"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "`hbm_gaussian`, `hbm_beta`, `hbm_binomial`"
msgstr "`hbm_gaussian`, `hbm_beta`, `hbm_binomial`"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "response, auxiliary list, the family's own columns"
msgstr "respons, daftar variabel penyerta, kolom milik family itu sendiri"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "the family and the formula"
msgstr "family dan formula"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Intermediate"
msgstr "Menengah"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "`hbm_flex`"
msgstr "`hbm_flex`"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "response, auxiliary list, family"
msgstr "respons, daftar variabel penyerta, family"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "the formula"
msgstr "formulanya"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Mahir"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "`create_model` (R alias `hbm`)"
msgstr "`create_model` (alias R `hbm`)"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "a formula"
msgstr "sebuah formula"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md
msgid "nothing"
msgstr "tidak ada"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:28
msgid "The formula at tier 3 is the R-style notation that Bambi reads, as in `y ~ x1 + x2`, the notation of lme4 and brms (Capretto et al., 2022). The tiers differ only in how much of the model the user writes."
msgstr "Formula di tingkat 3 adalah notasi bergaya R yang dibaca Bambi, seperti `y ~ x1 + x2`, yaitu notasi lme4 dan brms (Capretto dkk., 2022). Ketiga tingkat hanya berbeda dalam seberapa banyak bagian model yang ditulis pengguna."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:32
msgid "The reasoning"
msgstr "Penalarannya"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:34
msgid "Each tier delegates to the next"
msgstr "Setiap tingkat mendelegasikan ke tingkat berikutnya"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:36
msgid "The three tiers form one chain, each link removing a decision:"
msgstr "Ketiga tingkat membentuk satu rantai, dengan setiap mata rantai menghilangkan satu keputusan:"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:42
msgid "A tier 1 function fixes the family and calls `hbm_flex`, which writes the formula and calls `create_model`, where validation, the area random effect and construction happen."
msgstr "Fungsi tingkat 1 menetapkan family lalu memanggil `hbm_flex`, yang menulis formula lalu memanggil `create_model`, tempat validasi, efek acak area, dan konstruksi terjadi."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:45
msgid "Three separate implementations would be three places for behaviour to drift. A validation rule added to `create_model` but not to `hbm_beta` would make the same model behave differently depending on the function used. With one chain, the same specification gives the same formula, family and columns at every tier, and the test suite holds the three to it."
msgstr "Tiga implementasi terpisah berarti tiga tempat bagi perilaku untuk saling menjauh. Aturan validasi yang ditambahkan ke `create_model` tetapi tidak ke `hbm_beta` akan membuat model yang sama berperilaku berbeda tergantung fungsi yang dipakai. Dengan satu rantai, spesifikasi yang sama menghasilkan formula, family, dan kolom yang sama di setiap tingkat, dan rangkaian pengujian memastikan ketiganya memenuhi hal itu."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:50
msgid "Where a family's own arguments live"
msgstr "Tempat argumen khas sebuah family"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:52
msgid "Only tier 1 names a family's columns: `hbm_beta` takes `n`, `deff` and `squeeze`, and `hbm_binomial` takes `trials`. `hbm_flex` stays family-neutral and passes them through two generic arguments, as `hbm_flex()` in hbsaems does:"
msgstr "Hanya tingkat 1 yang menyebut kolom milik family: `hbm_beta` menerima `n`, `deff`, dan `squeeze`, dan `hbm_binomial` menerima `trials`. `hbm_flex` tetap netral terhadap family dan menyalurkannya melalui dua argumen umum, seperti yang dilakukan `hbm_flex()` di hbsaems:"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`addition_var` is the column the likelihood needs beside the response, and `aux_args` holds the rest. `sampling_var` is the one family column that `hbm_flex` names directly, as hbsaems keeps `sampling_variance` at that layer. A new family declares its columns in the registry ({doc}`family-registry`) and reaches `hbm_flex` through these channels, so `hbm_flex` never changes."
msgstr "`addition_var` adalah kolom yang dibutuhkan likelihood di samping respons, dan `aux_args` memuat sisanya. `sampling_var` adalah satu-satunya kolom family yang disebut langsung oleh `hbm_flex`, seperti halnya hbsaems mempertahankan `sampling_variance` di lapisan itu. Family baru mendeklarasikan kolomnya di registri ({doc}`family-registry`) dan mencapai `hbm_flex` melalui kedua saluran ini, sehingga `hbm_flex` tidak pernah berubah."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:70
msgid "Why the signatures are narrow"
msgstr "Mengapa signature-nya sempit"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:72
msgid "No interface accepts a catch-all `**kwargs`. Every argument is named, and each tier 1 function exposes only its own family's arguments. `hbm_gaussian(..., trials=\"n\")` is therefore a `TypeError` raised by Python at the call, naming the argument."
msgstr "Tidak ada antarmuka yang menerima `**kwargs` penampung segala. Setiap argumen dinamai, dan setiap fungsi tingkat 1 hanya menyediakan argumen milik family-nya sendiri. Karena itu `hbm_gaussian(..., trials=\"n\")` adalah `TypeError` yang dimunculkan Python pada saat pemanggilan, dengan menyebutkan argumennya."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:76
msgid "The same rule decides `fixed_params=`. `hbm_gaussian` and `hbm_beta` take it because their family has a parameter that can be fixed; `hbm_binomial` does not, since its only parameter is the one being estimated. A permissive signature would pass a mistake several layers down, or ignore it and build a different model from the one requested."
msgstr "Aturan yang sama menentukan `fixed_params=`. `hbm_gaussian` dan `hbm_beta` menerimanya karena family-nya memiliki parameter yang dapat ditetapkan; `hbm_binomial` tidak, karena satu-satunya parameternya adalah parameter yang diestimasi. Signature yang longgar akan meneruskan kesalahan beberapa lapis ke dalam, atau mengabaikannya dan membangun model yang berbeda dari yang diminta."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:81
msgid "Why the advanced tier still exists"
msgstr "Mengapa tingkat mahir tetap ada"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:83
msgid "Tiers 1 and 2 add one random-effect term, the random intercept `(1|area)`, through `area_var=`. Any other structure, such as a random slope `(x1|area)`, needs a formula, and a formula needs `create_model`. A script translated from hbsaems lands here too, since `hbm()` is `create_model()`."
msgstr "Tingkat 1 dan 2 menambahkan satu suku efek acak, yaitu intersep acak `(1|area)`, melalui `area_var=`. Struktur lain, misalnya kemiringan acak `(x1|area)`, membutuhkan formula, dan formula membutuhkan `create_model`. Skrip yang diterjemahkan dari hbsaems juga berakhir di sini, karena `hbm()` adalah `create_model()`."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:88
msgid "The formula still has limits. Every fixed-effect term must be a column name, so transformations and interactions are computed as columns first, at every tier, and the data checks see every column the model uses. The universal `hbm()` of hbsaems reaches all of brms, including spatial random effects; the advanced tier here reaches the Bambi formula, and spatial random effects are planned for a later version."
msgstr "Formula tetap memiliki batas. Setiap suku efek tetap harus berupa nama kolom, sehingga transformasi dan interaksi dihitung lebih dulu sebagai kolom, di setiap tingkat, dan pemeriksaan data melihat setiap kolom yang dipakai model. `hbm()` yang universal di hbsaems menjangkau seluruh brms, termasuk efek acak spasial; tingkat mahir di sini menjangkau formula Bambi, dan efek acak spasial direncanakan untuk versi berikutnya."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:94
msgid "One model underneath"
msgstr "Satu model di baliknya"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:96
msgid "Whatever the tier, the result is the same kind of object. One pipeline builds and fits it: the formula goes to Bambi, PyMC samples it with NUTS, and ArviZ holds the draws. The functions used after fitting, `check_convergence`, `compare_models`, `estimate_areas` and `update_model`, never need to know which tier built the model."
msgstr "Apa pun tingkatnya, hasilnya adalah objek berjenis sama. Satu pipeline membangun dan melakukan fitting-nya: formula diteruskan ke Bambi, PyMC mengambil sampelnya dengan NUTS, dan ArviZ menyimpan draw-nya. Fungsi yang dipakai setelah fitting, yaitu `check_convergence`, `compare_models`, `estimate_areas`, dan `update_model`, tidak pernah perlu tahu tingkat mana yang membangun model itu."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:101
msgid "Consequences"
msgstr "Konsekuensi"

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:103
msgid "**Start with the simplest interface that can express your model.** It has the fewest arguments to get wrong. Move up a tier when you need something it cannot express."
msgstr "**Mulailah dengan antarmuka paling sederhana yang dapat menyatakan model Anda.** Antarmuka itu memiliki paling sedikit argumen yang bisa salah. Naiklah satu tingkat ketika Anda membutuhkan sesuatu yang tidak dapat dinyatakannya."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:106
msgid "**Moving between tiers does not change the model.** The same specification at any tier gives the same formula and the same columns, so the analysis can start at tier 1 and move to tier 3 without starting over."
msgstr "**Berpindah tingkat tidak mengubah model.** Spesifikasi yang sama di tingkat mana pun menghasilkan formula yang sama dan kolom yang sama, sehingga analisis dapat dimulai di tingkat 1 dan pindah ke tingkat 3 tanpa mengulang dari awal."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:110
msgid "**`model.formula` is the formula that is fitted.** Whatever the tier, it shows the resolved formula, including the group term added for you."
msgstr "**`model.formula` adalah formula yang di-fit.** Apa pun tingkatnya, atribut ini menampilkan formula yang sudah diselesaikan, termasuk suku grup yang ditambahkan untuk Anda."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:113
msgid "**An R script maps onto a tier.** A call to `hbm()` carries over to `create_model()` or its alias `hbm`. A call to `hbm_betalogitnorm()` or `hbm_binlogitnorm()` maps onto `hbm_beta` or `hbm_binomial`."
msgstr "**Skrip R dipetakan ke satu tingkat.** Pemanggilan `hbm()` terbawa ke `create_model()` atau aliasnya, `hbm`. Pemanggilan `hbm_betalogitnorm()` atau `hbm_binlogitnorm()` dipetakan ke `hbm_beta` atau `hbm_binomial`."

#: ../../source/python/explanation/three-tier-api.md:117
msgid "**The graphical interface builds through tier 1.** Its family choice calls `hbm_gaussian`, `hbm_beta` or `hbm_binomial`, so a model built by clicking is the model a beginner builds in code."
msgstr "**Antarmuka grafis membangun model melalui tingkat 1.** Pilihan family-nya memanggil `hbm_gaussian`, `hbm_beta`, atau `hbm_binomial`, sehingga model yang dibangun dengan mengeklik adalah model yang dibangun pemula dalam kode."

